    "description": "Postman Collection for StageCraft Auditorium Sound Equipment Tracking System.\nBDF Group Assignment · Theme 25: Sound Equipment · Group JP-GAI2C-G10 (Issaku Tagarampudi).\nIncludes tests for full CRUD, validation, the join endpoint, and all 3 Twist tests.",
